<title>ITALY: Olivetti's Lexikon will list in 97-CEO.</title>
<headline>Olivetti's Lexikon will list in 97-CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian information technology group Olivetti is to list its Lexikon unit, which produces office equipment, on the New Stock exchange by the end of 1997, Chief executive officer Roberto Colaninno said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Colaninno made the statement in a meeting in Milan with financial analysts. It was his first such meeting since he was appointed CEO last month.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +382-66102321</p>
</text>
